WEBVTT

00:13.480 --> 00:15.750
Defying the law
by unlawfully imprisoning others,

00:16.160 --> 00:18.320
attempting to murder
the heir of a marquis.

00:18.830 --> 00:20.070
What punishment should you face?

00:20.710 --> 00:21.640
Your Highness,

00:22.000 --> 00:23.710
though your status is noble,

00:24.120 --> 00:26.600
by ancestral law,
the women of the inner palace

00:26.610 --> 00:28.000
may not interfere in state affairs.

00:28.640 --> 00:29.830
This is a court of law,

00:29.850 --> 00:31.870
not a place for Your Highness
to make a spectacle.

00:32.110 --> 00:33.600
Please conduct yourself with dignity

00:33.600 --> 00:34.640
and leave at once.

00:34.710 --> 00:35.840
In that case,

00:35.960 --> 00:37.280
I'll remain here

00:37.280 --> 00:38.470
and go nowhere today.

00:39.150 --> 00:41.290
Everyone in and around this yamen
is under my command.

00:41.600 --> 00:42.880
Until the court sends someone

00:42.880 --> 00:45.030
to uncover the truth of this case,

00:45.240 --> 00:46.600
no one here,

00:46.600 --> 00:48.070
including you, Prefect Yu,

00:48.560 --> 00:50.200
may leave this yamen.

00:52.600 --> 00:53.880
Commandery Princess Zhaoning,

00:53.888 --> 00:56.250
how dare you place an imperial official
under house arrest!

00:56.350 --> 00:57.110
This matter,

00:57.390 --> 00:59.280
I will report to His Majesty at once.

00:59.920 --> 01:00.600
Mo Yuan.

01:04.230 --> 01:06.040
How dare you!

01:06.870 --> 01:08.510
I am an imperial official!

01:11.000 --> 01:11.920
Xihe!

01:12.640 --> 01:13.560
Xihe!

01:15.280 --> 01:16.200
Xihe!

01:18.560 --> 01:19.430
Xihe!

01:20.870 --> 01:21.790
Are you all right?

01:22.000 --> 01:22.680
I'm fine.

01:23.950 --> 01:24.920
Magistrate Tang

01:24.920 --> 01:26.920
has confessed everything.

01:27.150 --> 01:28.510
The secret prison in Zenan

01:28.510 --> 01:30.150
was orchestrated by Yu Zao.

01:31.870 --> 01:33.150
I am willing to testify.

01:33.510 --> 01:34.840
It was Yu Zao who ordered

01:35.120 --> 01:36.680
the people to be secretly abducted,

01:36.680 --> 01:38.150
forced to mine ore,

01:38.150 --> 01:39.430
and illegally forge weapons

01:39.430 --> 01:40.400
for a treasonous plot.

01:40.840 --> 01:42.480
I have kept the account books

01:42.590 --> 01:44.120
and correspondence as evidence.

01:44.210 --> 01:46.350
Tang Juan, you wretch!
May you die a miserable death!

01:46.350 --> 01:47.680
Throw Yu Zao into prison

01:47.680 --> 01:49.024
and keep him under strict guard.

02:03.480 --> 02:03.950
Kneel!

02:03.960 --> 02:05.030
The prefectural office
is handling this case.

02:05.040 --> 02:06.720
Drop your weapons
and you will be spared!

02:07.200 --> 02:07.870
Run!

02:08.590 --> 02:09.430
Cui Jinbai!

02:10.310 --> 02:11.310
Cui Jinbai!

02:12.080 --> 02:13.280
Cui Jinbai, where are you?

02:13.280 --> 02:13.776
Don't move!

02:16.030 --> 02:17.030
Come out!

02:18.080 --> 02:18.710
Hurry!

02:19.360 --> 02:20.310
Cui Jinbai!

02:26.030 --> 02:27.560
Stone Cui!

03:46.900 --> 03:47.712
=Blossoms of Power=

03:47.712 --> 03:50.500
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:50.580 --> 03:53.540
=Episode 15=

03:56.030 --> 03:56.840
Hurry!

03:57.710 --> 03:58.560
Cui Jinbai!

03:58.620 --> 03:59.300
Hurry!

04:04.190 --> 04:05.310
Stone Cui!

04:06.710 --> 04:07.430
I'm here.

04:13.840 --> 04:14.560
How are you?

04:15.120 --> 04:15.870
Are you hurt?

04:15.870 --> 04:17.160
Did they... did they hurt you?

04:25.664 --> 04:27.160
Seeing how worried you are about me

04:28.720 --> 04:29.520
makes me very happy.

04:34.310 --> 04:35.040
Cui Jinbai,

04:38.000 --> 04:39.190
Yu Zao has been imprisoned,

04:39.200 --> 04:41.040
and the Prefectural Residence
has been seized.

04:41.480 --> 04:42.360
I'm grateful

04:42.680 --> 04:43.560
that you helped me.

04:44.240 --> 04:46.070
But what you said to me before,

04:46.070 --> 04:47.120
I hope you'll forget it.

04:47.480 --> 04:48.390
Do you understand?

04:48.400 --> 04:49.830
But you were clearly worried about me.

04:49.830 --> 04:51.024
That's because you helped me.

04:55.360 --> 04:55.870
Let's go.

05:17.920 --> 05:19.070
Greetings, Your Highness.

05:21.430 --> 05:22.480
These past few days,

05:25.120 --> 05:26.360
you have worked tirelessly.

05:26.720 --> 05:28.128
You flatter me, Your Highness.

05:30.520 --> 05:32.600
I'm not trying to interfere
with your investigation.

05:33.310 --> 05:34.950
I simply wish to remain by your side

05:35.360 --> 05:36.830
and be of some help to you.

05:36.928 --> 05:38.510
There's no need to trouble yourself.

05:38.900 --> 05:40.480
You should return to the palace at once,

05:40.704 --> 05:42.400
lest His Majesty become concerned.

05:46.920 --> 05:48.510
Though our wedding has been postponed,

05:49.070 --> 05:50.120
our goal remains the same.

05:50.500 --> 05:51.920
We both seek to eliminate corruption

05:51.920 --> 05:53.184
and bring justice to the people.

05:58.000 --> 05:59.040
I believe you

06:01.560 --> 06:04.070
also wish to solve Bu Shulin's
case as soon as possible.

06:04.720 --> 06:05.360
After all,

06:08.430 --> 06:09.680
you are as close as sisters.

06:24.950 --> 06:26.120
Throughout the interrogation,

06:27.120 --> 06:28.120
you will preside.

06:28.560 --> 06:29.560
I'll merely observe

06:30.430 --> 06:31.720
and lend my support.

06:33.904 --> 06:35.070
As you wish, Your Highness.

06:52.040 --> 06:53.000
Your Highness,

06:53.600 --> 06:56.000
there's no need
to waste your time on me.

06:56.560 --> 06:58.830
Hasn't Tang Juan already confessed?

06:59.120 --> 07:00.560
Whatever the sentence is,

07:00.920 --> 07:02.040
so be it.

07:02.430 --> 07:03.040
Yu Zao,

07:03.870 --> 07:05.070
you secretly transferred

07:05.270 --> 07:07.630
the imprisoned civilians
into the mountains to mine ore

07:07.720 --> 07:08.720
and forge weapons.

07:08.950 --> 07:10.040
But as far as I know,

07:10.270 --> 07:11.750
you hold no influence in the military.

07:11.760 --> 07:13.424
So the mastermind
behind the secret prison

07:13.430 --> 07:14.160
is not you.

07:14.560 --> 07:15.750
Who is the real mastermind?

07:18.000 --> 07:19.240
It's me.

07:20.928 --> 07:23.070
The secret prison
has caused countless tragedies.

07:23.270 --> 07:24.720
Families have been torn apart,

07:25.190 --> 07:26.270
and lives destroyed.

07:26.288 --> 07:27.610
Even if His Majesty
sentences your entire clan

07:27.616 --> 07:29.050
to death, it would not be excessive.

07:30.000 --> 07:30.750
Then...

07:32.310 --> 07:33.630
let it be.

07:34.950 --> 07:35.630
Yu Zao,

07:36.144 --> 07:38.190
have you not thought
of your wife and children?

07:38.190 --> 07:39.830
Or your brothers and sisters?

07:39.850 --> 07:41.408
Will you really stand by and watch them

07:41.440 --> 07:43.630
be dragged to their deaths
because of you?

07:59.390 --> 08:00.480
Yu Zao's attitude

08:00.830 --> 08:01.680
is very unusual.

08:02.160 --> 08:02.750
Indeed.

08:04.720 --> 08:05.750
He's far too confident.

08:08.160 --> 08:08.800
Your Highness,

08:09.920 --> 08:11.630
do you still remember
the Moon Palace game?

08:21.630 --> 08:22.550
Black can become white,

08:22.624 --> 08:23.830
and white can become black.

08:24.032 --> 08:25.970
In this world, it's more
than just a chess piece

08:25.984 --> 08:27.780
that blurs the line
between black and white.

08:45.600 --> 08:46.840
Truth can become false,

08:48.576 --> 08:49.790
and false can become truth.

08:51.088 --> 08:53.552
Yu Zao faces the punishment
of extermination of the whole clan.

08:53.632 --> 08:55.550
Yet in prison,
he has remained remarkably calm,

08:55.840 --> 08:58.320
without offering a single word
in defense of his wife or clan.

08:58.750 --> 09:00.416
That means
there's a strong possibility...

09:00.432 --> 09:01.360
The Yu Zao in prison

09:01.870 --> 09:03.120
is not the real Yu Zao.

09:03.910 --> 09:04.910
Whether he's real or not,

09:05.360 --> 09:07.200
that depends on your next.

09:24.784 --> 09:26.256
I've kept you waiting, Your Highness.

09:27.120 --> 09:27.630
Not for long.

09:28.096 --> 09:29.472
When it comes to waiting for you,

09:29.632 --> 09:30.960
I have all the time in the world.

09:33.790 --> 09:36.080
Why is it that you can always
say such flirtatious things

09:36.480 --> 09:37.840
as if they were nothing?

09:37.904 --> 09:39.550
Because every word comes from the heart.

09:39.600 --> 09:41.296
If this is how
the conversation is going,

09:41.440 --> 09:42.440
I'll be leaving now.

09:42.960 --> 09:43.670
All right.

09:44.320 --> 09:45.720
Let's talk about something else.

09:53.600 --> 09:54.600
These documents

09:55.240 --> 09:57.030
are evidence
that Yu Zao accepted bribes.

09:57.030 --> 09:58.630
Every payment can be traced.

09:58.944 --> 10:01.150
Yet not a single payment
went to his wife or children.

10:01.720 --> 10:03.670
(Private Records of the Ningze Prefectural Treasury)
Nor did any of it go to his relatives.

10:04.390 --> 10:06.200
All the money ended up in one place.

10:06.790 --> 10:07.390
Yuzhou.

10:19.550 --> 10:21.080
You dropped this the other day.

10:30.750 --> 10:31.960
I'll be there on time tomorrow.

10:42.000 --> 10:42.840
Prefect Yu,

10:42.896 --> 10:45.312
your crimes warrant
the extermination of your whole clan,

10:45.440 --> 10:46.870
yet you don't even flinch.

10:47.200 --> 10:49.630
I've already made myself clear.

10:49.870 --> 10:51.750
I know my crimes deserve death.

10:52.120 --> 10:52.910
You two

10:53.510 --> 10:55.510
shouldn't waste any more time on me.

10:56.608 --> 10:58.590
You don't care
about your fake wife and children.

10:59.080 --> 11:00.150
Do you really care nothing

11:00.480 --> 11:01.720
for your real wife and children?

11:02.880 --> 11:04.790
What do you mean by this, Your Highness?

11:04.800 --> 11:06.960
You show no fear
of the extermination of your whole clan.

11:06.960 --> 11:08.600
That goes against basic human nature.

11:08.600 --> 11:09.960
Which leaves only one explanation.

11:10.360 --> 11:12.480
Those people are not your real family.

11:12.550 --> 11:13.750
That's why you remain unmoved.

11:14.200 --> 11:15.440
You're not the real Yu Zao.

11:16.600 --> 11:17.696
I don't know, Your Highness,

11:17.728 --> 11:19.240
why you would make such baseless claims.

11:19.240 --> 11:20.550
You may deny it all you like.

11:21.320 --> 11:22.840
But of all the bribe money you took,

11:22.880 --> 11:23.840
not a single payment

11:23.840 --> 11:26.200
was sent to your wife
or relatives in the capital.

11:26.750 --> 11:27.960
Instead, it all went to Yuzhou.

11:28.440 --> 11:31.000
I imagine someone
very important to you is there.

11:31.080 --> 11:31.960
The real Yu Zao

11:31.960 --> 11:32.976
was ambushed by bandits

11:32.976 --> 11:34.750
on his way to his post two years ago.

11:34.750 --> 11:35.870
Your people killed him,

11:36.120 --> 11:37.630
and you assumed his identity.

11:37.960 --> 11:39.000
For the past two years,

11:39.000 --> 11:40.120
you never returned home,

11:40.300 --> 11:42.550
only kept in touch
with Yu Zao's family through letters.

11:43.000 --> 11:44.080
You and the mastermind

11:44.080 --> 11:45.750
planned, over those two years,

11:45.870 --> 11:47.510
to make full use of the secret prison

11:47.510 --> 11:49.120
and forge enough weapons.

11:49.488 --> 11:50.840
Then you would find an opportunity

11:50.840 --> 11:52.200
to disappear without a trace.

11:57.200 --> 11:58.440
I never expected

12:00.080 --> 12:01.870
you would uncover even this.

12:02.480 --> 12:04.976
If you admit your false identity
and reveal the mastermind,

12:05.270 --> 12:07.270
I will spare your
real wife and children.

12:09.390 --> 12:10.390
What do you say?

12:11.630 --> 12:13.000
Given the situation,

12:14.080 --> 12:16.840
is there a better choice
than what Your Highness has offered?

12:21.380 --> 12:25.060
(Zenan Prefecture)

12:25.080 --> 12:26.496
The imperial decree has been issued.

12:26.752 --> 12:28.512
You will pay
for your crimes with your life.

12:28.992 --> 12:30.720
That will bring this matter to a close.

12:30.910 --> 12:32.440
Your real wife and children

12:33.200 --> 12:34.390
have now been spared.

12:35.440 --> 12:36.670
You can tell us now, can't you?

12:39.320 --> 12:40.870
It was the Duke of Ying.

12:42.960 --> 12:44.390
Twenty years ago,

12:44.670 --> 12:47.440
I joined the army
under the Duke of Ying.

12:47.840 --> 12:49.630
The Duke of Ying
showed me great kindness.

12:50.440 --> 12:51.600
I could not refuse

12:52.240 --> 12:53.790
any of his orders.

12:54.750 --> 12:55.960
The Duke of Ying

12:57.360 --> 12:58.670
is in Anlan now?

13:01.000 --> 13:02.720
Something has happened
to the Duke of Ying.

13:03.600 --> 13:06.030
He had close dealings
with a Hu merchant.

13:06.790 --> 13:07.600
In the past,

13:07.750 --> 13:09.390
he secretly obtained poisons

13:09.480 --> 13:11.360
through that merchant.

13:12.480 --> 13:14.670
The merchant gained leverage over him

13:14.670 --> 13:16.600
and became increasingly overbearing.

13:17.150 --> 13:20.080
The Duke of Ying decided to silence him.

13:21.030 --> 13:22.030
Unexpectedly,

13:22.030 --> 13:25.120
the merchant poisoned
the Duke of Ying and escaped.

13:26.510 --> 13:28.030
After being poisoned, the Duke of Ying

13:28.550 --> 13:30.670
could barely eat anything.

13:31.080 --> 13:32.670
His insides burned with unbearable pain,

13:32.910 --> 13:34.150
leaving him in constant agony.

13:35.840 --> 13:37.150
After that,

13:37.840 --> 13:39.360
his whereabouts became unknown.

13:43.320 --> 13:44.240
My fellow citizens,

13:44.340 --> 13:46.710
I am the Deputy Chief Justice
of the Court of Judicial Review.

13:46.720 --> 13:47.790
By order of the court,

13:48.256 --> 13:50.352
I have come to resolve
the secret prison case.

13:50.440 --> 13:51.910
The culprit impersonated Yu Zao,

13:52.000 --> 13:54.200
and all his accomplices
have been arrested.

13:54.784 --> 13:55.630
The secret prison

13:56.750 --> 13:58.000
has been completely destroyed.

13:58.240 --> 14:00.480
The court is fully aware
of the suffering you have endured.

14:01.120 --> 14:02.750
His Majesty is deeply grieved as well.

14:03.184 --> 14:04.200
By His Majesty's decree,

14:04.896 --> 14:06.480
all victims of the secret prison case

14:06.720 --> 14:07.550
and their families

14:08.360 --> 14:09.390
will receive relief.

14:09.504 --> 14:11.630
His Majesty has appointed
Commandery Princess Zhaoning

14:11.840 --> 14:13.030
to oversee these arrangements.

14:18.240 --> 14:18.870
Everyone,

14:19.232 --> 14:21.104
those who suffered
in the secret prison case

14:22.080 --> 14:23.320
and lost a family member,

14:23.408 --> 14:24.840
please proceed to the green banner.

14:25.320 --> 14:27.200
Each person
will receive 500 copper coins

14:27.200 --> 14:28.000
and 25 kg of rice.

14:28.010 --> 14:29.560
The elderly, the weak,
ladies, and kids

14:29.570 --> 14:30.820
may proceed to the yellow banner.

14:30.840 --> 14:32.990
Each person will receive
an additional 6.25 kg of millet.

14:33.000 --> 14:34.440
Those who are ill or injured

14:34.670 --> 14:35.910
may proceed to the red banner.

14:36.256 --> 14:37.960
A physician will examine you personally.

14:38.032 --> 14:39.370
Anyone wishing to file a complaint

14:39.390 --> 14:40.630
may go to the white banner.

14:40.800 --> 14:42.630
A legal clerk
will help prepare your petition.

14:43.150 --> 14:44.150
Hot soup and rice cakes

14:44.150 --> 14:45.600
have been prepared at every station.

14:45.840 --> 14:47.150
Please help yourselves.

14:47.270 --> 14:49.630
- Thank You, Your Majesty!
- Thank You, Your Majesty!

14:50.390 --> 14:51.360
Thank You, Your Majesty!

14:51.630 --> 14:53.984
- Thank you, Your Highness!
- Thank you, Your Highness!

14:54.000 --> 14:55.120
Thank you, Your Highness!

14:55.440 --> 14:56.240
Please, rise.

14:56.870 --> 14:57.390
Please rise.

14:57.390 --> 14:58.150
Please, rise.

14:58.150 --> 14:59.200
Everyone, please rise.

14:59.472 --> 15:00.480
Please, all of you, rise.

15:00.480 --> 15:01.080
Please rise.

15:01.480 --> 15:02.600
Thank you, Your Highness.

15:02.800 --> 15:03.720
Go collect your relief.

15:04.720 --> 15:05.910
Thank you, Your Highness.

15:07.030 --> 15:08.030
Here, take it slow.

15:17.550 --> 15:19.320
Your Highness,
by the Crown Prince's order,

15:19.720 --> 15:20.660
the front of this stele

15:20.704 --> 15:22.360
is engraved
with the Relief Proclamation.

15:22.496 --> 15:24.550
Anyone left alone
because of official injustice

15:24.768 --> 15:26.576
will receive 50 copper coins each month.

15:27.088 --> 15:28.360
If a prisoner dies of illness,

15:28.360 --> 15:30.240
(Relief Proclamation)
the body must be examined

15:30.240 --> 15:31.230
by the coroner,
the family, and local elders.

15:31.248 --> 15:33.184
The back of the stele bears
the Collective Accountability Order.

15:33.216 --> 15:35.230
If three wrongful imprisonments
occur within a prefecture,

15:35.240 --> 15:36.752
the prefect will be branded and exiled.

15:36.760 --> 15:37.830
If there are more than five,

15:37.840 --> 15:39.990
their entire clan
will be permanently barred from office.

15:40.016 --> 15:41.730
The secret prison case
has now been solved.

15:41.750 --> 15:43.630
The Crown Prince
deserves some credit as well.

15:43.960 --> 15:45.360
What did the Crown Prince give you

15:45.696 --> 15:47.120
to make you keep taking his side?

15:47.600 --> 15:49.600
The Crown Prince
is always helping Your Highness.

15:49.600 --> 15:51.580
I don't need any favors
from him to take his side.

15:51.630 --> 15:54.360
If Your Highness and the Crown Prince
become husband and wife

15:54.360 --> 15:55.710
and govern the East Palace together,

15:55.720 --> 15:57.520
it would truly
be a blessing for the people.

15:58.790 --> 16:00.670
Are you really no longer considering

16:00.670 --> 16:02.200
marrying the Crown Prince?

16:02.320 --> 16:03.390
Once you enter the palace,

16:04.224 --> 16:05.790
there can be no room for a soft heart.

16:49.136 --> 16:50.048
Your Highness,

16:50.050 --> 16:52.480
Crown Prince's carriage
has been following us from a distance.

16:52.480 --> 16:53.510
He hasn't come any closer.

16:56.200 --> 16:57.080
Just ignore him.

17:34.640 --> 17:36.880
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

17:38.210 --> 17:40.460
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

17:41.780 --> 17:47.060
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

17:48.990 --> 17:51.930
♪I've hidden so many words♪

17:52.550 --> 17:55.350
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

17:56.220 --> 18:03.190
♪So never uncover♪

18:03.380 --> 18:05.740
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

18:06.870 --> 18:09.600
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

18:10.560 --> 18:15.900
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

18:17.660 --> 18:20.480
♪Every answer I gave♪

18:21.280 --> 18:24.130
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

18:24.920 --> 18:28.290
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

18:29.550 --> 18:30.720
You truly are

18:30.752 --> 18:32.240
a fairy beneath the Jade Terrace moon,

18:32.400 --> 18:33.720
standing gracefully in the breeze.

18:44.680 --> 18:46.110
And you

18:46.310 --> 18:48.790
are no different from a snake
that won't leave my side.

18:49.400 --> 18:50.110
That's quite true.

18:50.256 --> 18:51.510
I do tend to cling to people.

18:53.296 --> 18:54.960
The secret prison case in Zenan District

18:55.100 --> 18:56.400
was brought to a successful close

18:56.560 --> 18:57.750
thanks to your brilliant plan.

18:59.350 --> 19:01.240
Though you keep saying
it's for mutual benefit,

19:01.310 --> 19:02.944
you've also brought justice
to the people

19:02.992 --> 19:04.070
with the greatest care.

19:05.510 --> 19:06.680
If Bu Shulin

19:06.790 --> 19:08.512
were not the heir
of the Marquis of Shunan,

19:09.030 --> 19:10.640
I wouldn't have gotten involved

19:10.640 --> 19:11.720
from the very beginning.

19:16.550 --> 19:17.690
Then why don't we join forces

19:18.720 --> 19:20.830
to bring down the entire
Marquis of Shunan's Manor

19:21.010 --> 19:22.830
and absorb them all
into the Northwest Army?

19:23.264 --> 19:24.160
What do you think?

19:28.720 --> 19:29.200
See?

19:29.960 --> 19:32.350
Why must you make yourself
sound so heartless?

19:33.920 --> 19:34.640
Your Highness,

19:35.790 --> 19:36.790
no matter what you say,

19:38.270 --> 19:39.270
this engagement

19:39.680 --> 19:41.070
must be broken.

19:57.472 --> 19:58.640
You are bullying me again.

20:17.970 --> 20:21.040
♪Light as a dream, time drifts by♪

20:22.110 --> 20:24.720
♪Pushing the sea
of stars to flow across♪

20:26.160 --> 20:28.740
♪Flowers wilt and bloom again♪

20:29.190 --> 20:31.530
♪In an endless cycle♪

20:34.170 --> 20:37.090
♪Whispers beneath the moon♪

20:37.630 --> 20:40.740
♪Slowly spread across the branches♪

20:41.540 --> 20:43.410
♪Longing is so beautiful♪

20:43.650 --> 20:48.090
♪How many still wander
as they did in their youth?♪

20:50.050 --> 20:52.720
♪Amidst the flickering lights♪

20:54.080 --> 20:56.790
♪Alone for several autumns♪

20:58.180 --> 21:00.630
♪How to choose the one♪

21:01.010 --> 21:04.570
♪To be with forever?♪

21:05.650 --> 21:08.940
♪When I gaze upon you♪

21:09.570 --> 21:12.910
♪Flower petals twirl gently in my heart♪

21:13.510 --> 21:14.970
♪Gracefully♪

21:15.680 --> 21:20.740
♪For all eternity♪

21:21.440 --> 21:23.000
It doesn't matter if some things

21:23.500 --> 21:24.736
take a little longer.

21:24.832 --> 21:28.020
♪Quietly reflect in your sparkling eyes♪

21:28.830 --> 21:29.680
I'm willing to wait.

21:29.680 --> 21:31.930
♪Scattered red petals fall like rain♪

21:32.390 --> 21:36.230
♪It's a wonderful time in the world♪

21:37.170 --> 21:40.010
♪Bits of worries and sorrows♪

21:40.410 --> 21:44.020
♪Are gently gathered
into your elegant sleeves♪

21:45.130 --> 21:47.890
♪Gradually, on the misty path♪

21:48.390 --> 21:52.190
♪Not a trace of sorrow can be found♪

21:58.940 --> 22:01.020
(Zenan Post Station)

22:07.400 --> 22:08.310
Your Highness, look.

22:12.640 --> 22:14.240
I'd like to travel with you.

22:14.380 --> 22:16.160
We can look after each other
along the way.

22:16.176 --> 22:16.820
What do you say?

22:16.848 --> 22:17.570
I don't need that.

22:23.960 --> 22:24.920
But I do.

22:31.640 --> 22:33.160
Don't you want to know

22:33.580 --> 22:35.310
the truth behind
Consort Liang's poisoning?

22:36.790 --> 22:38.350
Before Yu Zao was executed, he told me

22:38.496 --> 22:40.350
the mastermind
behind the secret prison case

22:40.350 --> 22:41.310
was the Duke of Ying.

22:41.680 --> 22:43.920
He also bought poison
from the merchant many times.

22:43.984 --> 22:45.410
After committing so many evil deeds,

22:45.420 --> 22:46.920
he was poisoned by that very merchant.

22:46.930 --> 22:49.216
He should now be hiding
somewhere in the imperial capital.

22:50.200 --> 22:51.510
You're exceptionally perceptive.

22:51.510 --> 22:53.030
I'd like to join forces
with you again

22:53.030 --> 22:54.030
to find his whereabouts.

22:58.020 --> 22:59.776
This has nothing to do
with our engagement.

23:00.640 --> 23:01.480
We'll work together

23:01.960 --> 23:03.200
only to find the real culprit.

23:03.880 --> 23:04.400
Very well.

23:05.270 --> 23:06.030
I agree.

23:36.160 --> 23:37.104
Return to the palace.

23:42.220 --> 23:45.420
(Residence of the Heir
of the Marquis of Shunan)

23:49.920 --> 23:51.424
You were injured in the black prison,

23:51.424 --> 23:52.690
so you need to rest and recover.

23:52.720 --> 23:54.030
Avoid cold and spicy foods.

23:54.480 --> 23:55.640
I still can't eat that.

23:56.030 --> 23:57.510
Then... then take a look at this.

23:57.510 --> 23:59.280
Shouldn't I
be eating something nourishing?

24:00.720 --> 24:02.270
You should listen to Physician Xie.

24:05.350 --> 24:06.440
I was only

24:06.440 --> 24:09.480
trying to appear a little
more delicate before Physician Xie

24:09.480 --> 24:10.640
so he would take pity on me.

24:11.540 --> 24:13.110
- Seeing him in person today.
- Please.

24:13.110 --> 24:15.880
Physician Xie truly has the grace
of a jade-like immortal.

24:17.240 --> 24:19.960
Then how does Physician Xie
compare to Vice Minister Cui?

24:21.240 --> 24:23.680
Physician Xie is as gentle
and refined as jade.

24:23.880 --> 24:24.720
As for Cui Jinbai,

24:24.720 --> 24:26.830
he's nothing but a dull,
useless lump of stone.

24:26.830 --> 24:27.640
How can jade

24:27.640 --> 24:28.960
be compared to stone?

24:29.110 --> 24:30.790
Young Master, you do love to joke.

24:31.070 --> 24:32.070
I mean every word.

24:32.200 --> 24:33.030
I'll take my leave.

24:41.264 --> 24:42.880
I have matters to attend to at home.

24:43.100 --> 24:44.000
I'll be going as well.

24:44.112 --> 24:45.830
- I'll come see you another day.
- Xihe...

24:52.030 --> 24:53.270
What sweet words you have.

24:53.328 --> 24:54.480
Looks like you've recovered.

24:55.830 --> 24:57.000
Just now,

24:57.000 --> 24:58.720
I was only complimenting our guest.

24:58.720 --> 25:00.440
I didn't mean to put you down.

25:00.440 --> 25:01.680
I'm glad you're feeling better.

25:07.160 --> 25:08.830
Jin Shan, look at him.

25:08.830 --> 25:10.000
Such a terrible temper.

25:12.480 --> 25:13.480
Go see him off.

25:13.880 --> 25:14.400
Yes.

25:29.590 --> 25:30.270
Young Master,

25:30.352 --> 25:32.384
I've escorted
Vice Minister Cui to his carriage.

25:32.448 --> 25:34.416
If he's gone, then he's gone.
No need to tell me.

25:37.000 --> 25:37.640
Jin Shan,

25:38.070 --> 25:39.880
where's that box from Shiweizhai?

25:39.904 --> 25:41.000
The one carved with peonies?

25:41.000 --> 25:42.480
That's the one. Go bring it to me.

25:42.960 --> 25:44.880
I saw Vice Minister Cui was quite upset,

25:44.880 --> 25:46.270
so I already gave it to him.

25:48.000 --> 25:49.480
Who told you to give it to him?

25:49.640 --> 25:51.110
Who told you to give it to him?

25:51.110 --> 25:52.750
Why are you so worked up, Young Master?

25:52.750 --> 25:54.030
It's only a box of pastries.

26:08.720 --> 26:09.790
Stone Cui!

26:14.790 --> 26:15.480
Stone Cui!

26:16.830 --> 26:17.440
Stone Cui!

26:23.960 --> 26:25.790
I gave you the wrong box of pastries.

26:27.880 --> 26:29.270
Then who was it meant for?

26:30.272 --> 26:32.240
Wang Sanlang
of the Marquis of Zhenbei's Manor.

26:36.830 --> 26:38.350
You're giving him something like this?

26:39.240 --> 26:40.960
You two must be very close.

26:51.480 --> 26:52.680
We're just drinking buddies.

26:53.168 --> 26:55.400
I promised him long ago.
I couldn't go back on my word.

26:55.400 --> 26:56.330
Don't take it to heart.

26:56.480 --> 26:57.960
I'll give you a new box another day.

27:11.720 --> 27:14.480
I've given instructions regarding
Your Highness and the Crown Prince's

27:14.576 --> 27:15.750
search for the Duke of Ying.

27:16.080 --> 27:17.750
Every apothecary
in the imperial capital,

27:17.960 --> 27:19.750
if anyone tries to buy antidotes,

27:19.750 --> 27:20.720
I'll know about it.

27:20.752 --> 27:22.864
I'll have to trouble
Physician Xie again this time.

27:22.920 --> 27:24.490
No need to be so polite, Your Highness.

27:24.510 --> 27:26.110
Your wisdom and decisiveness

27:26.790 --> 27:27.880
have earned my admiration.

27:28.550 --> 27:29.830
To have you as a friend

27:29.830 --> 27:30.830
is my great fortune.

27:31.270 --> 27:32.440
You flatter me, Physician Xie.

27:33.310 --> 27:35.510
Actually, there's something
I've always wondered.

27:36.110 --> 27:37.350
Back then, Physician Xie,

27:37.350 --> 27:39.640
why did you sever ties
with the Duke of Xie,

27:40.000 --> 27:42.240
give up your title,
and become a physician?

27:48.000 --> 27:49.350
The reason I studied medicine

27:49.640 --> 27:50.720
was because of my mother.

27:50.720 --> 27:53.250
She died from a prescription
mistakenly written by a physician.

27:53.640 --> 27:55.000
The medicine wasn't poisonous,

27:55.216 --> 27:56.540
but it wasn't the right treatment.

27:57.264 --> 27:58.680
My mother took it for three years

27:58.864 --> 27:59.960
and died without a cure.

28:00.550 --> 28:01.550
And all of it

28:02.480 --> 28:04.240
was arranged by the man I called father,

28:04.750 --> 28:06.070
the Duke of Xie.

28:06.750 --> 28:08.640
Why was the Duke of Xie so heartless?

28:09.000 --> 28:10.680
He had someone he loved in his youth.

28:11.270 --> 28:13.350
To marry again,
he murdered his first wife

28:13.960 --> 28:15.030
after careful planning.

28:15.152 --> 28:16.830
Yet he pretended
to be a devoted husband,

28:16.830 --> 28:18.140
showing endless care and concern.

28:18.680 --> 28:19.920
That was why

28:20.816 --> 28:23.640
I couldn't bear to stay in the
Duke of Xie's Manor another moment.

28:28.912 --> 28:31.000
Being able to speak honestly
with Your Highness today

28:31.072 --> 28:33.040
has eased the burden
I've carried in my heart.

28:33.200 --> 28:34.070
I'm truly grateful.

28:34.440 --> 28:35.790
Just remember, Physician Xie,

28:36.030 --> 28:37.310
we are true friends.

28:37.880 --> 28:39.640
If you ever face any hardship,

28:40.000 --> 28:41.640
I'll do everything I can to help.

28:46.540 --> 28:47.580
(Baicao Herb House)

28:47.590 --> 28:49.550
Those people did indeed buy antidotes.

28:50.400 --> 28:51.790
Do you know who they are?

28:54.030 --> 28:54.960
Speak at once.

28:55.550 --> 28:57.750
They were from the Duke of Xie's Manor.

29:04.790 --> 29:05.400
Young Master,

29:06.030 --> 29:07.000
should we

29:07.216 --> 29:09.550
inform the Crown Prince
and Commandery Princess first?

29:09.830 --> 29:10.270
No.

29:10.750 --> 29:11.510
I'll go myself.

29:12.160 --> 29:13.136
Three days from now,

29:13.550 --> 29:14.480
if I haven't returned,

29:15.200 --> 29:17.440
inform the Crown Prince
and Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

29:17.960 --> 29:18.440
Yes.

29:21.980 --> 29:23.580
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

29:24.270 --> 29:25.070
Your Highness,

29:26.368 --> 29:28.144
something has happened to Physician Xie.

29:35.110 --> 29:38.000
Duke of Xie dared not invite a renowned
physician to treat Duke of Ying,

29:38.016 --> 29:40.240
so he could only search
the city's apothecaries in secret

29:40.240 --> 29:41.400
for antidotal herbs.

29:41.400 --> 29:41.960
Your Highness,

29:42.440 --> 29:43.480
what if

29:43.480 --> 29:44.920
the Duke of Xie denies it?

29:48.720 --> 29:49.310
Your Highness,

29:49.552 --> 29:51.790
the message has already
been sent to the Crown Prince.

29:52.030 --> 29:52.790
His Highness said

29:52.790 --> 29:54.200
everything is up to Your Highness.

29:54.310 --> 29:55.030
How wonderful.

29:55.310 --> 29:58.030
Crown Prince respects Your Highness
from the bottom of his heart.

29:58.200 --> 29:59.350
Your Highness's decisions

29:59.440 --> 30:02.030
have always had
the Crown Prince's full support.

30:02.030 --> 30:03.110
You two

30:03.500 --> 30:05.480
never miss a chance
to speak for the Crown Prince.

30:16.260 --> 30:18.300
(Duke of Xie's Manor)

30:18.400 --> 30:20.970
Your Highness, my lady says she hasn't
been feeling well lately

30:20.976 --> 30:22.470
and is unable to receive Your Highness.

30:22.480 --> 30:23.350
Once she has recovered,

30:23.350 --> 30:25.008
she'll send
Your Highness an invitation.

30:28.920 --> 30:30.160
Your Highness's cat ran off.

30:31.590 --> 30:33.090
- What? Your Highness...
- Catch it!

30:33.104 --> 30:34.624
Having you announce my arrival

30:34.830 --> 30:36.590
was merely to show her some courtesy.

30:41.488 --> 30:42.640
What are you waiting for?

30:42.640 --> 30:43.480
Go help!

30:48.510 --> 30:49.960
It's over there! Hurry!

30:59.456 --> 31:00.768
(It smells like medicine.)

31:04.790 --> 31:05.510
To the south.

31:06.440 --> 31:08.960
Greetings, Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

31:11.220 --> 31:12.500
(Duke of Xie's Manor)

31:12.540 --> 31:14.900
(Yuan, Wife of the Duke of Xie)

31:14.920 --> 31:16.550
This is the Duke of Xie's Manor.

31:17.510 --> 31:19.310
How can Your Highness
search it so openly?

31:19.550 --> 31:20.880
My cat went missing here.

31:21.008 --> 31:22.290
Naturally, I have to look for it.

31:23.830 --> 31:24.440
Mo Yu.

31:26.960 --> 31:27.640
How dare you!

31:29.640 --> 31:31.110
Commandery Princess Zhaoning,

31:32.640 --> 31:34.880
you certainly have some nerve.

31:35.960 --> 31:36.720
Duke.

31:39.140 --> 31:40.660
(Duke of Xie)
Your Highness,

31:40.680 --> 31:43.030
do you take the imperial capital
for the northwest?

31:43.200 --> 31:45.270
Neither princes nor princesses

31:45.550 --> 31:48.310
would dare behave with such arrogance.

31:50.920 --> 31:52.000
Greetings, Duke of Xie.

31:53.720 --> 31:55.750
I'm only looking for my cat.

31:57.750 --> 31:58.480
Guards!

32:05.550 --> 32:06.160
Mo Yuan.

32:06.160 --> 32:08.540
(Duke of Xie's Manor)

32:18.640 --> 32:20.200
His Majesty has granted me 500 guards.

32:21.350 --> 32:22.960
The Duke's guards

32:22.960 --> 32:24.110
number only forty or fifty.

32:24.350 --> 32:26.400
Do you truly intend
to stand against me, Duke?

32:26.790 --> 32:28.240
I will never allow you

32:28.240 --> 32:29.664
to disgrace the Duke of Xie's Manor.

32:34.768 --> 32:36.510
The Duke of Xie's Manor
is heavily guarded.

32:36.510 --> 32:37.720
If we remain at a standoff,

32:37.960 --> 32:39.440
Physician Xie will be put in danger.

32:39.920 --> 32:41.440
We should make this matter bigger

32:41.450 --> 32:43.060
and bring
the Prefecture of Jingzhao here.

32:43.070 --> 32:44.770
We'll use their authority
to our advantage.

32:44.784 --> 32:45.920
Please calm down, both of you.

32:45.920 --> 32:48.128
(Gathering Auspiciousness and Virtue)
Please calm down!

32:48.200 --> 32:48.830
Prefect Zhang,

32:49.568 --> 32:51.680
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
is abusing her authority

32:51.920 --> 32:53.590
and insists on searching my manor.

32:54.510 --> 32:55.160
Prefect Zhang,

32:55.696 --> 32:57.880
the golden plaque bestowed
by His Majesty is missing.

32:58.110 --> 33:00.790
The Duke of Xie and his wife
refuse to return it.

33:01.000 --> 33:02.400
What utter nonsense!

33:03.590 --> 33:05.790
Your Highness, do you have any evidence?

33:06.016 --> 33:07.590
We'll have our evidence once we find it.

33:10.464 --> 33:11.750
Do you realize, Your Highness,

33:11.920 --> 33:14.440
that if the golden plaque is not
in the Duke of Xie's Manor,

33:14.510 --> 33:16.880
you will be caned according to the law?

33:17.070 --> 33:20.440
I'm certain the golden plaque
is in the Duke of Xie's Manor.

33:26.048 --> 33:26.848
Duke of Xie,

33:26.848 --> 33:29.270
the loss of the golden plaque
is a matter of great importance.

33:29.270 --> 33:30.680
I dare not take it lightly.

33:30.680 --> 33:31.310
Why not

33:31.310 --> 33:34.070
allow me to bring two guards

33:34.070 --> 33:35.000
to conduct a search?

33:35.200 --> 33:35.590
You...

33:36.030 --> 33:37.000
Thank you, Prefect Zhang.

33:46.200 --> 33:47.310
This is the last room.

33:53.904 --> 33:55.030
Your Highness, please stop.

33:55.520 --> 33:57.110
This is the Xie family ancestral hall.

33:57.350 --> 33:59.240
Outsiders are not permitted inside.

34:01.000 --> 34:01.550
Your Highness,

34:01.880 --> 34:05.030
this hall enshrines
our ancestors' spirit tablets.

34:05.030 --> 34:06.640
Those outside the family
should not enter.

34:06.640 --> 34:08.360
Perhaps we should leave it at that.

34:09.110 --> 34:10.150
Precisely because of that,

34:10.670 --> 34:12.840
this is the most concealed place.

34:14.710 --> 34:17.070
Are you trying to disturb the peace

34:17.070 --> 34:18.070
of my Xie ancestors?

34:18.230 --> 34:19.550
If it's not found here,

34:19.760 --> 34:21.480
I'll personally apologize

34:21.480 --> 34:23.232
before the Xie family's
ancestral tablets.

34:33.820 --> 34:35.340
(Xie Family Ancestral Hall)

34:38.740 --> 34:42.500
(Spirit Tablets
of the Xie Family Ancestors)

34:43.400 --> 34:44.110
My goodness!

34:50.460 --> 34:53.140
(Spirit Tablets
of the Xie Family Ancestors)

34:54.500 --> 34:56.060
(Ning)

34:56.800 --> 34:57.760
The golden plaque!

34:58.190 --> 34:58.960
That's impossible!

34:58.960 --> 35:01.800
If the Duke of Xie refuses to accept
this, then appeal to His Majesty.

35:04.640 --> 35:06.320
Once we're inside
the Duke of Xie's Manor,

35:06.576 --> 35:08.432
it'll be your turn
to make your contribution.

35:09.776 --> 35:11.232
(Ning)
We need to lure the Duke of Xie

35:11.232 --> 35:12.630
out of his manor,

35:12.630 --> 35:14.760
so the Crown Prince
can find the Duke of Ying

35:14.760 --> 35:15.760
and rescue Xie Yunhuai.

35:16.510 --> 35:17.840
Use this to lure Du Huo.

35:19.550 --> 35:20.400
(To the south.)

35:21.000 --> 35:21.550
Mo Yu.

35:22.000 --> 35:22.630
How dare you!

35:24.700 --> 35:26.460
(Xie Family Ancestral Hall)

35:35.260 --> 35:37.740
(Xie Family Ancestral Hall)

35:37.740 --> 35:40.140
(Sixian Hall)

35:40.880 --> 35:41.510
Your Highness,

35:41.630 --> 35:43.760
Commandery Princess suspects the Duke
of Xie's Manor has a secret passage.

35:43.808 --> 35:45.530
To make it easier
to move the Duke of Ying,

35:45.550 --> 35:47.070
it shouldn't have only one exit.

35:47.070 --> 35:48.496
It must connect to a second exit.

35:49.880 --> 35:51.360
Tian Yuan, bring me the map.

35:59.030 --> 36:01.550
(The Imperial Palace)
A single passage can have many exits.

36:01.568 --> 36:03.150
They're built by a waterside pavilion,

36:03.150 --> 36:04.880
leading directly to the underground
waterway for an easy escape.

36:04.890 --> 36:06.960
On the southeastern side
of the Duke of Xie's Manor,

36:06.976 --> 36:07.984
there is indeed a river.

36:08.360 --> 36:10.480
But there's only a bare dock.

36:10.710 --> 36:11.920
There isn't a single building.

36:11.920 --> 36:13.500
It's nothing but the riverbed and rocks.

36:13.550 --> 36:14.710
How could there be an exit?

36:15.230 --> 36:17.070
I once read
in the military defense records

36:17.630 --> 36:18.360
that an exit

36:18.670 --> 36:20.920
could be disguised as a mooring post.

36:21.550 --> 36:22.480
On the surface,

36:23.056 --> 36:24.840
it looks just like
any other mooring post.

36:25.230 --> 36:26.400
But it's actually hollow,

36:26.510 --> 36:27.872
with a hidden mechanism inside.

36:28.400 --> 36:29.030
Tian Yuan,

36:29.800 --> 36:32.070
bring me twenty guards
who are skilled swimmers.

36:32.630 --> 36:34.550
There must be a secret passage
beneath the dock.

36:34.550 --> 36:35.328
(Dock)

36:36.150 --> 36:36.880
Your Majesty,

36:37.070 --> 36:38.230
throughout the realm,

36:38.360 --> 36:39.920
only the Commandery Princess

36:39.920 --> 36:41.590
possesses this imperial golden plaque.

36:41.590 --> 36:43.280
Even if I stole it, it would be useless.

36:43.400 --> 36:45.760
You're mistaken, Duke of Xie.

36:45.840 --> 36:47.480
Once someone leaves
the imperial capital,

36:47.920 --> 36:50.880
local officials recognize
only the imperial golden plaque.

36:50.880 --> 36:53.440
Seeing it is the same
as seeing His Majesty himself.

36:53.670 --> 36:55.550
They need only obey.

36:56.150 --> 36:59.088
Your Majesty, the Xie family has served
with distinction for generations.

36:59.320 --> 37:01.030
I have never
harbored disloyal intentions.

37:01.150 --> 37:03.440
Your heart lies within your own body.

37:04.440 --> 37:06.070
How could His Majesty know

37:06.070 --> 37:08.320
whether you harbor disloyal intentions?

37:08.510 --> 37:11.030
Minister Tao is unmatched
in the art of debate.

37:11.030 --> 37:13.360
I can't outargue you,

37:14.190 --> 37:17.150
but I will never allow
such slander and false accusations.

37:25.030 --> 37:25.670
Who's there?

38:07.190 --> 38:09.070
Your Highness?

38:09.400 --> 38:10.880
The Duke of Ying is gravely ill.

38:11.840 --> 38:13.550
How can you recover

38:13.550 --> 38:14.670
in this dark chamber?

38:15.480 --> 38:16.480
Why not come with me?

38:17.190 --> 38:19.510
I'll find another renowned physician
to treat you.

38:21.920 --> 38:23.550
I have no desire

38:25.230 --> 38:27.440
for Your Highness renowned physicians.

38:29.070 --> 38:30.590
Since Your Highness

38:31.000 --> 38:32.480
has walked in here,

38:33.030 --> 38:34.030
I'm afraid

38:34.880 --> 38:37.510
you won't be walking out
through this door again.

38:43.110 --> 38:45.190
The Duke must be so ill

38:46.190 --> 38:48.280
that you've forgotten
how to judge the situation.

38:49.550 --> 38:50.400
Move!

39:04.590 --> 39:05.360
Let us go!

39:14.480 --> 39:15.400
Let him go.

39:16.880 --> 39:17.800
Your Highness...

39:41.840 --> 39:43.480
I still have many questions

39:44.400 --> 39:45.360
to ask you.

39:48.840 --> 39:49.480
Your Majesty,

39:50.480 --> 39:51.670
the imperial golden plaque

39:51.760 --> 39:53.360
was not stolen by the Duke of Xie.

39:56.590 --> 39:57.360
Your Highness,

39:57.880 --> 39:59.920
wasn't that what you said yourself?

39:59.920 --> 40:01.070
I never said

40:01.070 --> 40:02.710
the Duke of Xie stole the golden plaque.

40:03.550 --> 40:05.070
It had been lent to Xie Yunhuai.

40:05.630 --> 40:06.920
Xie Yunhuai?

40:07.100 --> 40:09.730
He has lived on the outskirts
of the capital these past few years,

40:09.744 --> 40:10.800
treating the common people.

40:11.070 --> 40:12.400
To make traveling easier,

40:12.710 --> 40:14.070
I lent him

40:14.070 --> 40:15.190
the golden plaque.

40:15.710 --> 40:17.590
But he disappeared a few days ago,

40:17.744 --> 40:20.190
while the golden plaque
turned up in the Duke of Xie's Manor.

40:20.880 --> 40:22.190
That is why I concluded

40:23.550 --> 40:25.000
he was being held in the manor.

40:25.800 --> 40:26.960
Duke of Xie,

40:26.960 --> 40:27.920
is Yunhuai

40:28.800 --> 40:30.510
really in your manor?

40:31.030 --> 40:31.920
Your Majesty,

40:32.400 --> 40:34.230
Prefect Zhang has already
searched my manor.

40:34.230 --> 40:35.510
Did he find my son?

40:36.230 --> 40:37.510
Your Majesty,

40:37.510 --> 40:38.110
I did not.

40:38.110 --> 40:38.720
Your Majesty,

40:38.840 --> 40:40.176
Crown Prince requests an audience.

40:40.360 --> 40:41.030
Let him enter.

40:50.480 --> 40:52.480
Greetings, Father.

40:55.280 --> 40:57.070
Greetings, Your Majesty.

40:57.840 --> 40:58.960
Rise.

40:59.320 --> 41:01.030
What exactly happened?

41:01.110 --> 41:02.280
I was held in a secret chamber

41:02.280 --> 41:04.256
behind the wall
of the Xie family ancestral hall.

41:04.400 --> 41:05.710
I was fortunate to escape.

41:07.840 --> 41:08.480
Your Majesty,

41:09.150 --> 41:10.150
my son

41:10.630 --> 41:13.630
has long resented my remarriage.

41:14.280 --> 41:16.440
He has always been
prejudiced against me.

41:17.800 --> 41:19.150
I did not imprison him.

41:19.150 --> 41:19.760
I only

41:20.480 --> 41:23.230
wanted him to stay at the manor
so we could spend more time together

41:23.480 --> 41:25.630
and resolve the rift between us.

41:26.280 --> 41:27.280
Duke of Xie,

41:27.510 --> 41:29.880
you denied it outright
and concealed the truth.

41:30.440 --> 41:33.360
You have committed
the crime of deceiving your sovereign.

41:33.760 --> 41:34.920
As this is your first offense,

41:34.920 --> 41:36.000
your salary will
be suspended for one year.

41:36.000 --> 41:37.328
You are confined to your manor

41:37.400 --> 41:38.630
to reflect upon your conduct.

41:38.880 --> 41:40.440
Thank you, Your Majesty, for your mercy.

41:40.880 --> 41:43.960
I shall return and reflect on
my actions behind closed doors.

41:49.670 --> 41:51.320
Thanks, Your Majesty.

41:57.630 --> 41:58.230
Your Majesty,

41:58.920 --> 42:01.070
I have one more request.

42:01.440 --> 42:02.320
Speak.

42:05.880 --> 42:07.440
Lady Fan, the mother of Xie Yunhuai,

42:07.450 --> 42:09.920
was virtuous and wise,
managed the household with distinction,

42:10.280 --> 42:11.280
raised her children well,

42:11.280 --> 42:12.710
and was respected by the whole clan.

42:12.920 --> 42:15.280
I humbly ask Father
to issue another imperial decree,

42:15.472 --> 42:18.224
posthumously conferring upon Lady Fan
the title of First Rank Lady,

42:18.480 --> 42:20.840
so that both justice and propriety
may be upheld.

42:22.360 --> 42:23.230
Huayong,

42:23.320 --> 42:26.030
your proposal is most appropriate.

42:26.190 --> 42:28.510
Lady Fan's virtue

42:29.030 --> 42:30.480
deserves this honor.

42:31.776 --> 42:33.296
Why aren't you thanking His Majesty?

42:36.144 --> 42:37.800
Thank you
for Your Majesty's great grace.

42:38.110 --> 42:39.280
Thank you, Your Majesty.

42:39.280 --> 42:42.940
(Receiving the Mandate
and Establishing the Foundation)

42:54.590 --> 42:56.710
He refused to send reinforcements,

42:56.710 --> 42:58.150
causing Prince Qian's death,

42:58.150 --> 42:59.800
then claimed the throne himself!

42:59.800 --> 43:00.630
How dare you!

43:00.640 --> 43:01.880
Duke of Wei has returned.

43:01.920 --> 43:02.400
Youyou,

43:03.440 --> 43:04.280
my daughter

43:04.440 --> 43:06.550
isn't someone
who can be married off so easily.

43:06.550 --> 43:08.096
He's far too scrawny.

43:08.096 --> 43:10.190
How could he become
a son-in-law of the northwest?

43:10.190 --> 43:11.920
Only a real man like your father

43:11.920 --> 43:13.110
and brothers will do.

43:17.111 --> 43:20.051
♪I've hidden so many words♪

43:20.671 --> 43:23.471
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

43:24.341 --> 43:31.311
♪So never uncover♪

43:31.501 --> 43:33.861
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

43:34.991 --> 43:37.721
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

43:38.681 --> 43:44.021
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

43:45.781 --> 43:48.601
♪Every answer I gave♪

43:49.401 --> 43:52.251
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

43:53.041 --> 43:56.411
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

43:56.671 --> 43:59.981
♪How hard it truly was?♪

44:02.951 --> 44:06.391
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

44:07.381 --> 44:09.711
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

44:10.981 --> 44:16.741
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

44:18.151 --> 44:21.281
♪It's a shame I never could♪

44:21.731 --> 44:24.741
♪Give you a moon in return♪

44:24.851 --> 44:31.491
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

44:31.491 --> 44:35.161
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

44:36.031 --> 44:38.791
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

44:39.231 --> 44:42.361
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

44:42.801 --> 44:48.751
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

44:50.151 --> 44:53.701
♪You'll never♪

44:53.981 --> 45:03.451
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

45:29.621 --> 45:33.101
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
